Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sg-compositor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xwayland
Description: Stained Glass OS Wayland compositor
 The compositor that hosts a Stained Glass desktop session. Derived from cage
 0.2.0 on wlroots 0.18; it will add lock-screen input isolation and
 session-scoped screen capture and input injection for remote access.
